# Local-only material. It stays on disk and is never deleted; it just isn't published.
# Trackable: README.md, USAGE.md, manifest.json, claims/ and tools/.

# Pilot evidence: session metrics, provenance and planning runs with local paths.
/pilot/
# Review packets hold verbatim copies of their inputs, source included.
/reviews/
# Drafts are working proposals; base/ and evidence/ snapshot source bytes.
/drafts/

# Claims are Markdown only. The root *secret*/*credential* rules would hide claims about
# secrets, so claims/ is default-deny: descend every directory, admit only *.md, then
# re-ignore the root's directory rules. Non-Markdown support files belong outside claims/.
/claims/**
!/claims/**/
!/claims/**/*.md
/claims/**/node_modules/
/claims/**/dist/
/claims/**/tmp/
/claims/**/.agent/
